'''Level 5124''' was one of the levels of the [[ecumenopolis]] [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. During the [[Imperial Era]], [[Tomkip Towers]], which contained a [[Axis network safehouse|safehouse]] that was used by [[Axis network]], was located on the level.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Level 5124 first appeared in "[[Ever Been to Ghorman?]]," the fourth episode of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' released on [[Disney+]]<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" /> on [[April 29]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref>

